# Folia Web build-time environment variables.
#
# VITE_QQ_API_BASE: where the frontend sends QQ Music API requests.
#   The built-in serverless entry (Cloudflare Worker / Vercel) always uses
#   the same-origin path /api/qq.
#   This value MUST be visible at `vite build` time, otherwise the frontend
#   throws "VITE_QQ_API_BASE is not configured" and the QQ Music entry does
#   nothing when clicked.
#   It is a public value (baked into the client bundle), not a secret.
#   The real secret is the runtime QQ_SESSION_SECRET; set it with
#   `wrangler secret put` and never commit it here.
VITE_QQ_API_BASE=/api/qq
